 Storm; per-thread GX mixer and K055555 state

Harness, 2400 frames: render-thread pictures identical to inline at all ten
checkpoints, sound identical. Mystic Warriors left inline: on the render
thread it draws 81 stray sprite pixels at frame 50, cause not yet found.

